<title>EGYPT: Egypt raises Oct Suez Blend 10 cents against Brent.</title>
<headline>Egypt raises Oct Suez Blend 10 cents against Brent.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt is raising the October prices of its Gulf of Suez Blend and two other grades of crude by 10 U.S. cents against Dated Brent, the state's Egyptian General Petroleum Corp (EGPC) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The prices of the other three grades remain unchanged from September against Dated Brent, it said.  </p>
<p>Here are the new differentials for October against Dated Brent (September differentials in brackets),</p>
<p>    Gulf of Suez    -$2.15  (-$2.25)</p>
<p>    Belayim	   -$3.00  (-$3.00)</p>
<p>    Ras Badran	-$3.20  (-$3.20)</p>
<p>    Ras Behar	 -$1.35  (-$1.45)</p>
<p>    Ras Gharib	-$4.00  (-$4.00)</p>
<p>    Zeit Bay	  -$1.40  (-$1.50)</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Wright +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
